&lt;h4 id="info4blog-작성">info4blog 작성&lt;/h4>
&lt;p>Claude에 아래 트리거 입력&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;code>info4blog 갱신 (마지막 작성일: YYYY-MM-DD)&lt;/code>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>마지막 작성일이 없다면&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;code>info4blog 갱신&lt;/code>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>으로 요청.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>How to make blog with Hugo</title><link>https://alsspp01.github.io/posts/2024-12-01%EB%B8%94%EB%A1%9C%EA%B7%B8/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://alsspp01.github.io/posts/2024-12-01%EB%B8%94%EB%A1%9C%EA%B7%B8/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="0-make-new-post-or-page">0. Make New post or page&lt;/h3>
&lt;h4 id="-problem">💥 Problem&lt;/h4>
&lt;p>새 문서를 만들었으나 반영이 안 될 때&lt;/p>
&lt;h4 id="-solution">💡 Solution&lt;/h4>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>git clone -&amp;gt; local로 파일 가져오기&lt;/li>
&lt;li>cmd 켜기&lt;/li>
&lt;li>해당 local 경로에서 &lt;code>hugo server&lt;/code> 또는 &lt;code>hugo&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>commit &amp;amp; push&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>⛔ hugo가 안 깔려 있을 경우&lt;/p>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>powershell 관리자 권한으로 열어 chocolatey 깔기&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>choco install hugo-extended&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;hr>
&lt;h3 id="1-permission-error">1. Permission Error&lt;/h3>
&lt;h4 id="-problem-1">💥 Problem&lt;/h4>
&lt;pre tabindex="0">&lt;code>Error: Error copying static files: open 
C:\path\to\myblog\public\static\the_image.png: Access is denied.
&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;h4 id="-solution-1">💡 Solution&lt;/h4>
&lt;p>경로에 한글이 있을 가능성이 있음.&lt;br>
경로에 &amp;ldquo;문서&amp;rdquo; 등 한글이 있을 경우 static 파일을 읽어들이지 못함 + 권한오류 발생&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Theme Origin URL</title><link>https://alsspp01.github.io/posts/first_post/</link><pubDate>Thu, 11 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://alsspp01.github.io/posts/first_post/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="path">path&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://gokarna-hugo.netlify.app/posts/theme-documentation-basics/#installation">https://gokarna-hugo.netlify.app/posts/theme-documentation-basics/#installation&lt;/a>&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>